                "id": 13,
                "title": "Why Rapid Spikes Matter",
                "startTime": "08:00",
                "endTime": "08:45",
                "duration": 45.0,
                "spokenAnchor": "In medicine we don't like blood sugar spiking because it doesn't give your body time to mop it up, causing cellular damage.",
